  Each field, and why it is the right value:

    field        measured                        why it is right
    -----        --------                        ----------------
    transport    IPv6. Source and destination    this is the IPv6 server case, not IPv4
                 are both inside                 with an IPv6 address written on it
                 fd32:b1f0:dff8:1603::/64
